# Shared by the three Dockerfiles, all built from the repository root. The
# build stages copy the manifests, packages, demo, and scripts, so everything
# listed here is either rebuilt inside the image or never needed by one.
.git
.github
.changeset
.claude
.env
.env.*
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
demo/out
demo/recording.jsonl
docs
examples
fixtures
Dockerfile
Makefile
*.md
*.tgz
